    and context fitting — moved to `test_ollamarun_serve.py`. The
    canonical command is unchanged: `python3 test_ollamarun.py` runs both
    files and prints one verdict, and the new file also runs standalone.
  - Two required test gates. `test_pyflakes_clean` runs pyflakes over
    `ollamarun_lib/`, the entry script and both test files, tolerating
    only the deliberate re-export sites (`constants.py`'s hub names,
    `__init__.py`, and `repl._prompt_approval`'s compatibility
    re-export); the findings it drove out are fixed (`ui.py`'s unused
    imports, two placeholder-less f-strings, dead test locals, an
    undefined `Any` annotation, the Textual probe). `test_openai_sdk` no
