    hint and prints the SDK version it exercised.
  - Coverage-audit gap tests: the model-turn/agent-turn contrast (client
    tool calls are returned, never executed; the same call runs through
    the agent loop), an agent turn's backend failure (failed status, a
    terminal `turn.error`, a session holding only the user turn), a tool
    that errors (`ok: false`, the model continues), the HTTP replay of a
    truncated event buffer starting with `stream.gap`, the no-auth
    trusted-network pin, and a cancelled mid-stream turn's persisted
    partial-assistant session shape.
  - `test_serve_process`: the real-process smoke that spawns the shipped
    `ollamarun serve` against a stub Ollama, reads the bound address from
    the startup banner, sends SIGTERM mid-stream, and pins the drained
